# Process timeline for one host
# Purpose: rebuild the order of commands run on a suspected compromised machine
# Source investigation: investigations/thm-phishing-unfolding
# ATT&CK: supports investigation of T1059.001 (PowerShell), T1082/T1033/T1087 (Discovery)

<hostname> powershell
| sort _time
| table _time process.name process.command_line
